@1 = ~Wyvern Barbed Tail Strike~
@2 = ~Wyvern Barbed Tail Strike
(Alteration)

Level: 3
Range: Melee
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 0
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: Poison partial

Through this spell, the Black Dragon Disciple grows a dangerous wyvern tail, or alters his own tail if he already has one, and strikes his target. The spell deals 1d12 piercing damage and the creature must save vs. Poison at -2 or suffer poison damage depending on the caster level:

5th level: 4 damage, then 1 damage every 4 seconds
7th level: 8 damage, then 1 damage every 3 seconds
9th level: 12 damage, then 1 damage every 2 seconds
12th level and above: 16 damage, then 1 damage every second

The poison lasts 1 turn.~

// Combat log
@3 = ~Poisoned by the wyvern tail~
